Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

firmware/cyw43-firmware/nvram_rp2040.bin, nvram_rp2040.txt
  Board settings for the CYW43439 radio on the Raspberry Pi Pico W and
  Pico 2 W. Copied unchanged from the embassy project's cyw43-firmware
  folder (https://github.com/embassy-rs/embassy/tree/main/cyw43-firmware),
  which takes its blobs from georgerobotics/cyw43-driver. Licensed under
  the Infineon Permissive Binary License 1.0, whose text is beside them in
  LICENSE-permissive-binary-license-1.0.txt. The MIT and Apache-2.0
  licences above do not cover these two files.

tools/patches/rp2040js-sev-fix.patch
  A patch to wokwi/rp2040js (https://github.com/wokwi/rp2040js), MIT
  License, Copyright (c) 2021 Uri Shaked. Its context lines quote that
  project's source. tools/setup-emulator.sh clones rp2040js and applies it.

firmware/build-support/memory-rp2040.x, memory-rp2350.x
  Linker memory maps following the embassy-rp examples
  (https://github.com/embassy-rs/embassy, MIT OR Apache-2.0).

Firmware images built from this repository link the dependencies in
firmware/Cargo.lock, each under its own licence; the Wi-Fi builds also
embed the CYW43439 firmware from the cyw43-firmware crate (Infineon
Permissive Binary License 1.0). Pass those notices on with any image you
distribute.
